      "claim": "The driver's explanation of 'jam at Sembawang Road' is uncorroborated on this record. The only traffic artifact in the bundle, EV-ADVIS-05055-01, is MISSING with weight 0.0, and under POL-GEN-02 (limb 3) a MISSING artifact carries no fact. POL-NS-24 conditions the refund on arrival by the deadline and provides no traffic defence; no admissible evidence here supplies one, so the delay account cannot displace the deadline breach.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-05055-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
